        "id": 1541085
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-28T15:05:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello Patryk,\nOne issue I see with this approach is that we are losing 2 bits that we just allocated to the special image capture mode.\n\nCan you be more specific about what will be included in this CL such that a new command version is not necessary? There is a lot of intricacy between libec, biod, and ec and I want to make sure that all corners are covered.\n\nBest",
      "parentUuid": "e6a99616_58369fe9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8232,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 8236,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "7a847a27ce082a662fdb1869ff996c47e9b7a461",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ef811cbb_e896c5cb",
        "filename": "include/ec_commands.h",
        "patchSetId": 6
